      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand the code before improving it.The original test is simple — it checks two class-level modifiers in a single method with no explanation. I'll improve understandability by splitting into focused named methods, adding `@DisplayName` annotations, extracting the repeated `getModifiers()` call into a local variable, and removing unused imports.The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored test splits the original single method into two focused, named tests (`testCharSetIsPublic` and `testCharSetIsNotFinal`), adds `@DisplayName` annotations for clarity, extracts the repeated `getModifiers()` call into a local variable, and removes the six unused imports from the original."
